!Volatility Lab/data/backtest_1minute/status.json
!Volatility Lab/data/backtest_1minute/scope.json
Volatility Lab/data/backtest_futures/
!Volatility Lab/data/backtest_futures/*status.json
!Volatility Lab/data/backtest_futures/scope.json
Volatility Lab/data/google_archive/
